  "semantics_id": "tangent-frame",
  "description": "Normal-map convention and tangent frame of Painter's baked tangent-space normal (P0-NORMAL): green-channel direction for the OpenGL and DirectX formats, and which MikkTSpace frame mode (PerVertex or PerFragment) and sampler transform the UzPainter prototype must use to equal Painter's bake, with residuals against the normal-convention goldens.",
