      "entry_id": "green-channel-directx",
      "subject": "Green channel of Painter's baked tangent-space normal, DirectX normal map format (plane-dome pair, hit texels)",
      "status": "exact",
      "formula": "On the plane-dome pair the low frame is T = +u direction, B = +v direction (sign +1), N = the plane normal at every texel, so the baked value is the hit triangle's normal n expressed as t = (n.T, n.B, n.N). Encoding: code = floor(65535 (t / 2 + 1/2) + 1/2) per channel, RGB = (x, y, z); DirectX conversion: the green code becomes 65535 - green (y negated), red and blue unchanged.",
