    {
      "entry_id": "tangent-frame-per-fragment",
      "subject": "Tangent frame of Painter's baked normal with tangent space PerFragment (hemisphere pair, OpenGL, hit texels)",
      "status": "calibrated",
      "formula": "Per-corner MikkTSpace frames (t_i, sign_i) of the low mesh (genTangSpaceDefault), interpolated at the texel centre with the UV barycentric weights w_i: vT = sum w_i t_i, vN = sum w_i n_i (unnormalized). PerVertex: vB = sum w_i sign_i cross(n_i, t_i); PerFragment: vB = sign cross(vN, vT). inverse: t = normalize(s (n.cross(vB, vN), n.cross(vN, vT), n.cross(vT, vB))), s = sign of vT.cross(vB, vN); projection: t = normalize(n.T, n.B, n.N) with T, B, N normalized. Closest: PerFragment-inverse-opengl.",
      "public_sources": [
        {
          "source_id": "S-MIKK",
          "locator": "mikktspace.h: setTSpaceBasic, normal-map sampler"
